<title>UK: FTSE 100 claws back losses, ends nearly unchanged.</title>
<headline>FTSE 100 claws back losses, ends nearly unchanged.</headline>
<text>
<p>** FTSE 100 claws back most losses to end nearly</p>
<p>	 unchanged as gilts pare their losses.</p>
<p>** Rank rebounds ahead of year-end results.</p>
<p>** Lloyds rises to new peak after analysts meet.</p>
<p>** C&amp;W falls on profit-taking, phone charge cuts.</p>
</text>
